  "scope": "Simplify ArithmeticCyclicWord.rot_mod division and rotation algebra",
  "validation": "Paired target and all three direct tracked Lean clients pass with direct input pins and source-matched provider producer receipts. PackingBlocks and CellTransfer objects match; WindowCarry object bytes differ, but its namespace type/axiom and global simp/instance reports match with both target and client objects pinned.",
  "limitations": [
    "The whole project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure was not rebuilt. Direct provider source matches rely on prior producer receipts, and source hashes were not captured at the time of these builds.",
    "A missing ModularCancellation overlay stopped the initial baseline script before CellTransfer was invoked; the first three receipts and separately successful client retry are preserved. setup-failure.txt records the observed terminal error, not a Lean build log.",
    "The preliminary final target receipt references object/log paths reused by the final paired lane and is not independent validation.",
    "Single shared-load timing pairs do not establish general performance changes. Matching declarations/registrations do not establish equality of proof bodies, all persistent extensions, or untested downstream behavior.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; recorded hashes and first-provider paths require external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
